{{Quote|It's an artists' retreat, a place for creative outcasts to live together and think deep thoughts. There's a poet there, a man named Omar Berenko. Supposed to be briliant.|[[Elzar Mann]] speaks of Varykino to [[Avar Kriss]]|<ref name="Light of the Jedi">''[[The High Republic: Light of the Jedi]]''</ref>}}
'''Varykino''', also known as '''Lake Retreat''', was an island<ref name="BMF54">{{BuildFalconCite|54|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> amidst the [[water]]s of [[Naboo]]'s scenic [[Lake Country]]<ref name="CL2016">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> that housed [[Varykino Villa]],<ref name="NoP" /> an ancient dwelling of the [[Naboo (people)|Naboo]] epic [[poet]] [[Omar Berenko]] and the [[Naberrie family]] which took its name from the island.<ref name="BMF54" /> [[Paddy Accu]] served as the [[caretaker]] of the villa<ref name="Ultimate 2015">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> shortly before the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="ATOC">{{Film|II}}</ref>

